== A negated real literal is read in its type, then negated: a Float32 -0.1
== is the negation of the Float32 nearest 0.1, and separators and exponents
== are allowed (fixed with change decimals, r3.91).
Main :
    A := -1_000.5
    B Float32 := -0.1
    C := -1.0e-3
    D Float32 := -2.5e2
    PutLn(A, " ", B, " ", C, " ", D)
;
